msgstr "（哇……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(W-wow... That's-... )</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(W-wow... That's-... )"
msgstr "（哇……这真是……）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wait, better delete this. A picture of the suitcase is evidence just waiting to be found. )"
msgstr "（等等，最好把这段删了。这个行李箱的照片可是证据，随时都可能被发现。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Wait, no-... Why am I sorry...?! I-... Ahhh...!)</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wait, no-... Why am I sorry...?! I-... Ahhh...!)"
msgstr "（等等，不……我为什么要道歉……？！我……啊……！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Wait, was she in here with him?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Wait, was she in here with him?)"
msgstr "（等等，她当时和他一起在这里吗？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Wait- What was I even doing before all that? Right... moving forward. They're out of the way now at least. )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Wait- What was I even doing before all that? Right... moving forward. They're out of the way now at least. )"
msgstr "（等等——在那之前我到底在干嘛来着？对了……继续前进吧。至少他们现在都让开了。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Wait- what am I doing here...?! Getting touched by a-... )</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wait- what am I doing here...?! Getting touched by a-... )"
msgstr "（等等——我到底在干什么……？！被一个……摸来摸去……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Wait-.. I don't have enough money.. )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Wait-.. I don't have enough money.. )"
msgstr "（等等……我钱不够……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Wait... did he say... "whatever tip I want"...?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wait... did he say... \"whatever tip I want\"...?)"
msgstr "（等等……他是不是说了……“我想给多少小费就给多少”……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Was he even telling the truth...? I didn't think, I just- Did I just do that for... a lie? Fuck- Goddammit, Zoey. Get your shit together. )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Was he even telling the truth...? I didn't think, I just- Did I just do that for... a lie? Fuck- Goddammit, Zoey. Get your shit together. )"
msgstr "（他到底有没有说实话……？我根本就没思考，我只是——我竟然为了……一个谎言那样做？该死——该死，佐伊。清醒点！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Was that really the right thing to do...?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Was that really the right thing to do...?)"
msgstr "（那真的对吗……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Was that... Sarah on her phone? I really need to talk to her about all those viral Smutgram posts she keeps making... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Was that... Sarah on her phone? I really need to talk to her about all those viral Smutgram posts she keeps making... )"
msgstr "（那是……在手机上发东西的莎拉吗？我真的得跟她聊聊她那些一直在发的Smutgram病毒式帖子……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Was that... really worth it...?)</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Was that... really worth it...?)"
msgstr "（这……真的值得吗……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Watching a secret video feed of Max's customers...)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Watching a secret video feed of Max's customers...)"
msgstr "（正在观看马克斯客户的秘密视频画面……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Way to go, Zoey. Not only did you piss off the cartel and decide to piss away your big score, you've also ruined things for Sarah too.)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Way to go, Zoey. Not only did you piss off the cartel and decide to piss away your big score, you've also ruined things for Sarah too.)"
msgstr "（干得漂亮，佐伊。你不仅惹怒了卡特尔，还把自己辛辛苦苦赚来的大笔钱给糟蹋了，连莎拉的事也全搞砸了。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(We're all fine. Come on, Zoey. Blocker problem first.)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(We're all fine. Come on, Zoey. Blocker problem first.)"
msgstr "（我们都好好的。来吧，佐伊。先解决封锁者的问题。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Weirdo... )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Weirdo... )"
msgstr "（怪人……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Well look what we have here, the last part of the key! Better go unlock the door now.)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Well look what we have here, the last part of the key! Better go unlock the door now.)"
msgstr "（瞧我们找到了什么，钥匙的最后部分！现在去开门吧。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Well, here goes nothin'. Hopefully this works.)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Well, here goes nothin'. Hopefully this works.)"
msgstr "（好吧，豁出去了。希望这能行。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Well, should be an easy fix. )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Well, should be an easy fix. )"
msgstr "（嗯，应该很容易修好。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Well, that is one way to make some fuckbucks... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Well, that is one way to make some fuckbucks... )"
msgstr "（嗯，这倒是一种赚他妈的美元的方法……）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Well... More money wouldn't hurt, really... )"
msgstr "（嗯……说实话，多点钱也不是坏事……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Well... Only one way out. What was that saying about god closing a door and opening a window?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Well... Only one way out. What was that saying about god closing a door and opening a window?)"
msgstr "（嗯……只有一条出路。那句话怎么说来着？上帝关上一扇门，就会打开一扇窗。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Well... The whole point of these drinks is to loosen them up, I guess.)</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Well... The whole point of these drinks is to loosen them up, I guess.)"
msgstr "（嗯……这些饮料的作用，大概就是为了让他们放松下来吧。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Well... her boobs are out. Now I just need to take a picture of them.)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Well... her boobs are out. Now I just need to take a picture of them.)"
msgstr "（嗯……她的胸都露出来了。现在我只需要拍张照就行了。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Welp, thanks box. Didn't need those anyways. )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Welp, thanks box. Didn't need those anyways. )"
msgstr "（唉，谢了，这个框。反正也用不上这些。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Welp, time to move. Those guards are checking for tickets!)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Welp, time to move. Those guards are checking for tickets!)"
msgstr "（唉，得走了。那些守卫正在查票！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Welp. Onward and upward.)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Welp. Onward and upward.)"
msgstr "（唉，只能继续往前了。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Wh- This door must've just locked itself! Ugh... we already moved boxes into the bathroom, what the hell?! This must be recent. )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Wh- This door must've just locked itself! Ugh... we already moved boxes into the bathroom, what the hell?! This must be recent. )"
msgstr "（什——这扇门肯定是自己锁上的！该死……我们明明已经把箱子搬进浴室了，到底怎么回事啊？！这肯定是最近才发生的。）"

# rich_translation: <i>（<color=#EB83FF>我——</color>我到底在搞什么鬼？）</i>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(<color=#EB83FF>Wh-</color> What the hell am I doing?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Wh- What the hell am I doing?)"
msgstr "（我——我到底在搞什么鬼？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Wh-! I completely for</color>got they were watching us... nngh... )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wh-! I completely forgot they were watching us... nngh... )"
msgstr "（什——！我完全忘了他们还在看着我们……嗯……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Wh-.. ! )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Wh-.. ! )"
msgstr "（什……！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Wh-... Stayed because of... me...?)</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wh-... Stayed because of... me...?)"
msgstr "（为……为什么还留下来了……是因为……我吗……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Wh-... That's just... drunk talk... Right...?)</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wh-... That's just... drunk talk... Right...?)"
msgstr "（什……？那不过是……醉话……对吧……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Wh-... that's-... Different... )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wh-... that's-... Different... )"
msgstr "（什……这……不一样……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Wh-...?! N-no this-... I'm not getting-... N-no...!)</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Wh-...?! N-no this-... I'm not getting-... N-no...!)"
msgstr "（什——？！不——不是这样的……我——我不会接受的……不——不……！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What a night... I've basically pissed off everyone in the Redlight District, and now I smell like a dumpster. Just my luck.)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What a night... I've basically pissed off everyone in the Redlight District, and now I smell like a dumpster. Just my luck.)"
msgstr "（真是糟糕的一晚……我简直把红灯区的每个人都得罪了，现在身上还一股垃圾桶的臭味。我这也太倒霉了。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What a night... I've basically pissed off everyone in the redlight district, and now I smell like a dumpster. Just my luck.)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What a night... I've basically pissed off everyone in the redlight district, and now I smell like a dumpster. Just my luck.)"
msgstr "（真是难忘的一夜……我简直把红灯区的每个人都得罪了，现在身上还一股垃圾箱的味道。真够倒霉的。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What a subtle name for the place... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What a subtle name for the place... )"
msgstr "（这地方名字可真够隐晦的……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What am I doing... )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What am I doing... )"
msgstr "（我在做什么……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What am I doing...? This shouldn't feel... this good... I shouldn't- )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What am I doing...? This shouldn't feel... this good... I shouldn't- )"
msgstr "（我在做什么……？这不应该……感觉这么爽……我不应该——）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What am I doing? I can't do this to Lio... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What am I doing? I can't do this to Lio... )"
msgstr "（我在做什么？我怎么能对利奥这么做……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What am I doing?! Snap out of it, Zoey!)
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What am I doing?! Snap out of it, Zoey!)"
msgstr "（我在干什么啊！振作点，佐伊！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What am I getting myself into.. )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What am I getting myself into.. )"
msgstr "（我这是把自己卷进什么事儿了啊……）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What am I looking for? A better angle?)"
msgstr "（我在找什么？一个更好的角度？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(What am I-... doing...?)</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What am I-... doing...?)"
msgstr "（我到底在……干什么……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(What am I.. Doing..?)</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What am I.. Doing..?)"
msgstr "（我到底……在做什么……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What are you doing, Zoey... )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What are you doing, Zoey... )"
msgstr "（佐伊，你在干什么……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(What did I just-)</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What did I just-)"
msgstr "（我刚才到底——）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What do I do...? )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What do I do...? )"
msgstr "（我该怎么办……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What do I do...? I don't want to get into trouble... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What do I do...? I don't want to get into trouble... )"
msgstr "（我该怎么办……？我可不想惹上麻烦……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(What does he- )</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What does he- )"
msgstr "（他到底——）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What has come of this district... )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What has come of this district... )"
msgstr "（这个街区……到底成了什么样子……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What have I done...)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What have I done...)"
msgstr "（我到底干了什么……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What have I done?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What have I done?)"
msgstr "（我到底干了什么？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What have I gotten myself into... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What have I gotten myself into... )"
msgstr "（我到底把自己卷进什么麻烦了……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What have I gotten myself into?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What have I gotten myself into?)"
msgstr "（我这是把自己卷进什么事儿了？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What if it is...?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What if it is...?)"
msgstr "（要是真是……呢？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What is that sound?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What is that sound?)"
msgstr "（那是什么声音？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What is wrong with me?!)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What is wrong with me?!)"
msgstr "（我到底是怎么了？！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(What is-... wrong with me-... nghhh... )</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What is-... wrong with me-... nghhh... )"
msgstr "（我……我到底怎么了……啊啊啊……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(What is-... wrong with-... m- mnghh... )</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What is-... wrong with-... m- mnghh... )"
msgstr "（这到底……怎么了……嗯……嗯……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(What is... wrong with me... )</i></color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What is... wrong with me... )"
msgstr "（我……到底是怎么了……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What she doesn't know can't hurt her...)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What she doesn't know can't hurt her...)"
msgstr "（她不知道的事，不会伤害到她……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What the fuck is Peitho?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What the fuck is Peitho?)"
msgstr "（Peitho到底他妈的是个什么玩意儿？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What the fuck is going on? Is she doing this to... protect me? But... Should I really go along with it...?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What the fuck is going on? Is she doing this to... protect me? But... Should I really go along with it...?)"
msgstr "（这他妈到底是怎么回事？她这么做是为了……保护我吗？但是……我真的应该配合她吗……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What the fuck is this? Just some little cylinder device thing in here... The suitcase must be the bulk of all the fuckin' weight. )</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What the fuck is this? Just some little cylinder device thing in here... The suitcase must be the bulk of all the fuckin' weight. )"
msgstr "（这他妈的是什么？就只是个小小的圆柱形装置……这箱子肯定占了所有该死重量的大头。）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What the fuck was that?! Is someone watching us?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What the fuck was that?! Is someone watching us?)"
msgstr "（那他妈的是什么东西？！有人在监视我们吗？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What the fuck was that?!)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What the fuck was that?!)"
msgstr "（那特么是什么玩意儿？！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What the hell is a fuckbuck? This some sorta "GAG" thing? Ugh... there's no way I'm going to get locked out of my own bathroom... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What the hell is a fuckbuck? This some sorta \"GAG\" thing? Ugh... there's no way I'm going to get locked out of my own bathroom... )"
msgstr "（他妈的，什么玩意儿是“fuckbuck”？这算某种“GAG”装置吗？唉……我绝对不可能被锁在自己家浴室外面……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What the hell is this? Ugh, it smells! Better go give it to Calliach... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What the hell is this? Ugh, it smells! Better go give it to Calliach... )"
msgstr "（这他妈是什么？呃，好臭啊！还是拿去给卡利亚赫吧……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What was that all about? I hope she's alright... Her and her dad don't usually get into any arguments at all. Was it about me..?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What was that all about? I hope she's alright... Her and her dad don't usually get into any arguments at all. Was it about me..?)"
msgstr "（那到底是怎么回事？希望她没事……她和爸爸平时根本不会吵架的。难道是因为我吗……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What's going on, I thought the blockade was lifted?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What's going on, I thought the blockade was lifted?)"
msgstr "（到底怎么回事？我还以为封锁已经解除了呢？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What-.. !? She's groping my-.. ! )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What-.. !? She's groping my-.. ! )"
msgstr "（什……么！？她在摸我……！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What. Am. I. Doing...?!)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What. Am. I. Doing...?!)"
msgstr "（我……在……做……什……么……？！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What... Is this...?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(What... Is this...?)"
msgstr "（这……是什么……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(What... Was... That...?)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(What... Was... That...?)"
msgstr "（那……是……什么……？）"

# rich_translation: <i>（等我回到家，就赶紧把这点……<color=#EB83FF>痒痒的解决了</color>……然后就把这档子事忘了！）</i>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(When I'm home, I'll just quickly take care of this..  <color=#EB83FF>itch</color>..  And then I'll forget this ever happened.. ! )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(When I'm home, I'll just quickly take care of this..  itch..  And then I'll forget this ever happened.. ! )"
msgstr "（等我回到家，就赶紧把这点……痒痒的解决了……然后就把这档子事忘了！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Where did they even get these sea shells?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Where did they even get these sea shells?)"
msgstr "（他们到底从哪儿弄来这些贝壳的？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Where the hell is she?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Where the hell is she?)"
msgstr "（她到底在哪儿？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Whew! I made it out of those tunnels it seems!)</i>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "(Whew! I made it out of those tunnels it seems!)"
msgstr "（呼！看来我终于从那些隧道里出来了！）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Whew.. Quite the mess.. )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Whew.. Quite the mess.. )"
msgstr "（呼……可真够乱的……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Who is he... Talking about...? )</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Who is he... Talking about...? )"
msgstr "（他在说……谁呢……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF><i>(Who is this lady... he keeps mentioning...?)</i></color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Who is this lady... he keeps mentioning...?)"
msgstr "（这位女士是谁……他一直在提到她……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Who would've guessed these little technicalities could save me... )</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Who would've guessed these little technicalities could save me... )"
msgstr "（谁能想到这些小小的技术细节居然能救我……）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Whoever is on those videos, they wouldn't even know I saw them... so-... It's no big deal, right...?)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Whoever is on those videos, they wouldn't even know I saw them... so-... It's no big deal, right...?)"
msgstr "（不管那些视频里的人是谁，他们根本不会知道我看过……所以……这也不算什么大事，对吧……？）"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>(Whole lotta nothing.)</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "(Whole lotta nothing.)"
