msgstr "哦？我吗？呵呵——不。我宁愿……待在镜头后面，你懂的。我可不想让全世界来承受这整个破事，嘿嘿。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Oh- My little man doesn't even eat his food before testing it. As if I'd ever poison him. Tsk."
msgstr "哦——我这个小男人连饭都不先尝一口。我怎么可能毒他呢。啧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Pardon my manners, I'm Zoey."
msgstr "哦——请见谅，我叫佐伊。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Right. Heh, I'm assuming you've moved to a new spot?"
msgstr "哦——对啊。嘿嘿，我猜你搬去新地方了？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh- Right. You'll want to get fully charged up at a working station?"
msgstr "哦——对。你想在工作站把电充满吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Secret door. Of course."
msgstr "哦——秘密通道。当然啦。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- They're- Just like that- In an alley- Wow-"
msgstr "哦——他们——就那样——在小巷里——哇——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh, yeah. See ya around then, Cypher."
msgstr "哦——嗯，是啊。那到时候再见，赛弗。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh- No! I- mean- Heh- I don't mean you're not- I mean- Eheh..."
msgstr "哦——呃——不！我——我是说——嘿嘿——我不是说你不——我是说——呃呃……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh- Thanks?"
msgstr "哦——呃——谢谢？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh. Eheh- No problem!"
msgstr "哦——呃。诶嘿——没问题！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh. Yeah. That's weird."
msgstr "哦——呃……嗯，真奇怪。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh... He's asking you on a date. Apparently he made eye contact with you one time."
msgstr "哦……他是在约你约会。据说他跟你有过一次眼神交流。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh... I just did what had to be done to get you that battery."
msgstr "哦——呃……我只是做了必须做的事，才帮你拿到那块电池。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Oh- We don't have those either-"
msgstr "哦——我们也没有那些——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Well I can't read too well, hun. What'd he say in it?"
msgstr "哦——不过我视力不太好，亲爱的。他在信里写了什么？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Wow! The bed!"
msgstr "哦——哇！这张床！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah that's okay, Z. Sorry, I didn't mean to- I was just- Sorry. I've just been really worried about you, because..."
msgstr "哦——嗯，没关系啦，Z。抱歉，我不是那个意思——我只是——抱歉。我只是真的很担心你，因为……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, I don't smoke anymore. Kicked it a while ago."
msgstr "哦——是啊，我不抽烟了。早就戒了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, I think I already met her at the Glowing Hole."
msgstr "哦——是啊，我想我已经在“发光洞穴”见过她了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, that's okay."
msgstr "哦——嗯，没关系。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- crap I think someone's lookin'. We gotta make our move now!"
msgstr "哦——糟了！我好像有人在盯着我们。得赶紧行动了！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- heh, thanks!"
msgstr "哦——呵呵，谢谢！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh- heh. No worries. I've uh... seen worse!"
msgstr "哦——呵呵。别担心。我……见过更糟的！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- o-okay... So-... Do I-"
msgstr "哦——哦，好吧……那……我……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- uh- Heh. I've got a request. Can we-"
msgstr "哦——呃——呵呵。我有个请求。我们能不能——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- uh... heh- thanks!"
msgstr "哦——呃……嘿嘿，谢啦！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- wow."
msgstr "哦——哇。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- years at least. Daddy got 'em for me way back when."
msgstr "哦——至少好几年了吧。很久以前，爸爸就给我配了这副眼镜。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Max"
msgid "Oh-! ... Ohh... You know... I've never had a client complain about one either now that I think about it. Guess that's one good thing, huh?"
msgstr "哦——！……哦……你知道的……现在想想，还真没哪个客户抱怨过这一点呢。这倒也算个好处，对吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Er-"
msgstr "哦——！呃——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Heh- I uh- That's- I'm not-"
msgstr "哦——！嘿嘿——我、我那个——不是的——我不是——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Heh-..! Erm, thanks! It's all good..!"
msgstr "哦！嘿嘿……嗯，谢谢！没关系的……！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! I can do that! N-No problem!"
msgstr "哦！我当然可以！没——没问题！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! I... Thanks!"
msgstr "哦！我……谢谢！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh-! Okay!"
msgstr "哦——！好的！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! That's... That sounds... nice?"
msgstr "哦——！这……听起来……不错？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Well, no. I haven't. I would've noticed her. Plus, she would've tripped one of my security systems."
msgstr "哦！不，我没见过她。要是她来了，我肯定能注意到。而且，她肯定也会触发我的某个安保系统。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Wow! That's- Wow!"
msgstr "哦！哇！这真是——哇！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-.. I-.. Sorry..! Don't mind me..!"
msgstr "哦…我…对不起…！别在意我…！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-.. Right..! I'm on it!"
msgstr "哦……对！我这就去！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-..! Sorry, I'm not here for drinks."
msgstr "哦……！抱歉，我不是来喝酒的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-..! Sorry..! I was going for the wrong door, heh! I- I'm coming!"
msgstr "哦——！对不起……！我本来想开错门的，嘿嘿！我——我这就来！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Oh-... I see...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh-... I see..."
msgstr "哦……原来如此……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-... Uh... Th-thanks...!"
msgstr "哦……呃……谢……谢谢！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Oh-? Um- thanks.</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-? Um- thanks."
msgstr "哦？嗯……谢谢。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh. Yeah, that sucks. Maybe you should take it to a technician?"
msgstr "哦。是啊，真倒霉。要不你拿去让技术人员看看？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... I uhh-"
msgstr "哦……我，呃——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rosie"
msgid "Oh... My... God... You look amazing!"
msgstr "哦……我的……天哪……你看起来太惊艳了！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh... Okay."
msgstr "哦……好吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh... Really...?"
msgstr "哦……真的吗……？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... sweetheart... Come here..."
msgstr "哦……亲爱的……过来……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... sweetie... Do you want to talk about it...?"
msgstr "哦……亲爱的……你想聊聊这件事吗……？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... wow..."
msgstr "哦……哇……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh...- Uhm-... N-no! Sorry...!"
msgstr "哦……— 嗯……— 不——！对不起……！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh? It's an old BF-75d. These were everywhere before the crisis!"
msgstr "哦？这是旧款的 BF-75d。危机之前这种东西到处都是！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "Oh? Tell us!"
msgstr "哦？说来听听！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ohh fuck those are some hot milkers, ahaha!"
msgstr "哦哦，操，这些挤奶工可真够性感的啊，啊哈哈！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ohh fuck yes..., 'nything you say, babyy'! *hic*"
msgstr "哦哦，操，爽……你随便说什么都行，宝贝！*抽泣*"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh right... *hic* haven't even introduced myself...*hic* name is Cody."
msgstr "哦哦对啊……*hic*我连自我介绍都没做呢……*hic*我叫科迪。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh, okay. That's fine, you already helped me a lot with other stuff."
msgstr "哦，好吧。那也没关系，你之前已经帮了我很多了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Ohh-.. She sounds fun. I'll let her book me, hehe."
msgstr "哦——她听起来很有趣。就让她约我吧，嘿嘿。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh. Ohhh damn. Hey... *hic* hi there."
msgstr "哦……哦，该死。嘿……*hic* 嗨，你好。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh... *hic* you"
msgstr "哦……*哽咽*……你"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh...! That sounds funn!"
msgstr "哦哦哦……！听起来真有趣！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh~ fuck, fuck, fuck~ Yes~ Ooh~ Keep going~ Please~"
msgstr "哦哦哦~操，操，操~对~啊~继续~求你了~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh~ Holy shit, look at you go~"
msgstr "哦哦~ 我靠，瞧瞧你干得真棒~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohoho, just teasing, dear~ Look how red you are~!"
msgstr "哦哦哦，我只是开个玩笑啦，亲爱的~ 瞧你脸红成什么样了~！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohohoh~ Look, Issac. Someone's taking pictures of us."
msgstr "哦呵呵～看，伊萨克。有人在给我们拍照呢。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh~ Eager for head, hm?"
msgstr "哦~ 急着要口交，嗯？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh~ Zoey~ You're soaked down here~"
msgstr "哦~佐伊~你下面都湿透了~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Oi, let's go quit screwin' around and find another charging station."
msgstr "喂，别他妈磨磨蹭蹭了，快去找别的充电站吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay darling, we're going to help you get a little more comfortable around me. You're going to go use my shower."
msgstr "好的亲爱的，我们会帮你在我面前放松一点的。你现在去用我的淋浴吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I think I found the right port. Move your leg a bit."
msgstr "好了，我好像找到正确的端口了。把腿稍微挪一下。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, I will.</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I will."
msgstr "好的，我会的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I'll be right back with your order, sir."
msgstr "好的，先生，我马上回来拿您的订单。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I'll tell him..."
msgstr "好的，我会告诉他的……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, I-... I'll try...</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I-... I'll try..."
msgstr "好吧，我……我会试试的……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I... I guess I can manage that."
msgstr "好吧……我……我想我应该能应付得来。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay, darling."
msgstr "好的，亲爱的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay, dear..."
msgstr "好的，亲爱的……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, fine-... So...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, fine-... So..."
msgstr "好吧，行吧……那么……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, here. Take a look."
msgstr "好的，在这儿。看看吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, it was my boyfriend who told me."
msgstr "好吧，是我男朋友告诉我的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, no rush."
msgstr "好的，不着急。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, now how do we..."
msgstr "好了，接下来我们怎么……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "好啦，好啦。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, sounds good."
msgstr "好啊，没问题。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, well... Maybe you can ask Lio for help?"
msgstr "好吧……或许你可以问问利奥能不能帮忙？"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay-... But... Don't make it obvious, okay?</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay-... But... Don't make it obvious, okay?"
msgstr "好吧……不过……别太明显，行吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay. It's okay, Z. Sorry for bringing it up. Let's just... get these boxes unpacked, 'kay?"
msgstr "好吧。没关系的，Z。抱歉我提起了这件事。我们先把这些箱子拆了，好吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay. It's okay, Zoey. You don't have to say anything. Don't worry. I'm here for you no matter what."
msgstr "好的。没关系的，佐伊。你不必说什么。别担心。无论发生什么，我都会陪在你身边。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... So you mentioned Felicia used to be an outdoor cat? How long ago was that?"
msgstr "好吧……所以你提到费莉西娅以前是只野猫？那是什么时候的事？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... always a pleasure, officers..."
msgstr "好吧……能和警官们打交道，总是很愉快……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... and what do those ones do...?"
msgstr "好吧……那那些东西是干什么用的呢……？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... so now what?"
msgstr "好吧……那接下来该怎么做？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... so, I just... Start... washing...?"
msgstr "好吧……所以，我就是……开始……洗……？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay... touchy subject..."
msgstr "好吧……这个话题有点敏感……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay...? And how do I get it open?"
msgstr "好吧……？那要怎么把它打开呢？"

