msgid "Welcome to the Glowing Hole 2"
msgstr "欢迎来到发光洞穴 2"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Welcome to the Glowing Hole!"
msgstr "欢迎来到发光洞穴！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Welcome to the Glowing Hole! I love your hair!"
msgstr "欢迎来到发光洞穴！我喜欢你的头发！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "Welcome to the Glowing Hole. What can I-"
msgstr "欢迎来到发光洞穴。我能——"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>Welcome to the SLUT Service
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Welcome to the SLUT Service"
msgstr "欢迎来到 SLUT 服务"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <i>Welcome to the SLUT Service™ menu! Select an option...</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Welcome to the SLUT Service™ menu! Select an option..."
msgstr "欢迎来到 SLUT Service™ 菜单！请选择一个选项……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Welcome to the Witch's Cauldron~ What can I get ya~?"
msgstr "欢迎来到女巫的大锅~ 我能给你点啥~？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "Welcome, darling. We have only the finest of wares, all at the tip of your fingers. If you can pay."
msgstr "欢迎，亲爱的。我们这儿只有最顶级的商品，而且全都触手可及——只要你能付得起钱的话。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Salesman"
msgid "Welcome, welcome! Come closer! Don't be shy!"
msgstr "欢迎，欢迎！过来看看！别害羞啊！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Welcome, welcome. Looking for some company, cutie?"
msgstr "欢迎，欢迎。想找个人陪陪你吗，小可爱？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well I don't know. Just lie to them."
msgstr "谁知道呢？就骗他们呗。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well I'm not dead yet, so... pretty good?"
msgstr "我还没死呢，所以……算挺不错的吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well ain't this just wholesome?"
msgstr "这可不就挺温馨的吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well alright then... Guess I'll go give it a shot."
msgstr "好吧……那行吧……我猜我倒是可以试试。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well because you've been like super mega depressed ever since that whole... global orgy thing... the crisis..."
msgstr "因为自从那整个……全球群交事件……那场危机之后，你就一直处于超级抑郁的状态……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "Well give it here. Let's see it."
msgstr "那就拿来吧。让我看看。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "Well if you insist to just leave it on, I love the messy look on you."
msgstr "好吧，如果你坚持要让它就这么放着的话，我超喜欢你这种凌乱的样子。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well let's just say spicy things. I've got a limited amount of time to record ya, and you try to do... lewd things. Then I pay ya for 'em."
msgstr "嗯，就说是些刺激的东西吧。我录制你的时间有限，而你却想干……那些下流的事。然后我还能拿钱。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well maybe try..."
msgstr "嗯……要不试试？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well new or not, you look absolutely gorgeous!"
msgstr "不管新不新，你看起来简直太美了！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "Well then, miss waitress. Here's your tip."
msgstr "那么，女服务员小姐。这是你的小费。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "Well then. The way I see it, you have two choices."
msgstr "那么。在我看来，你有两个选择。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well there's a bunch more kitties here in the Res District that you can pet."
msgstr "喲，在住宅區這裡還有更多小貓可以讓你撫摸呢。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well there's the risk that the readers enjoy us for. You can do it, I know you can, Zoey. You've been so brave! Knock it out of the park!"
msgstr "嗯，读者们享受我们的地方，恰恰就在于这种风险。你能行的，我知道你一定行，佐伊。你一直都很勇敢！好好干，别让我失望！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well your nails are super nice!"
msgstr "你的指甲真的超漂亮的！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well! I didn't know I was getting a two for one sale!"
msgstr "哇！我没想到自己居然能买到“买一送一”的优惠！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, I had to crack the suitcase open. Just had some injector thing in there. No idea what it does, but I've got it."
msgstr "嗯，我不得不把那个行李箱撬开。里面有个什么注射器之类的东西。不知道是干嘛的，不过我拿到手了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, Klaudia can only take so much of a guy screaming \"Awooga!\" at the top of his lungs before she snaps."
msgstr "好吧，克劳迪娅也受不了一个家伙在顶头上冲“阿沃加！”这种声音，她迟早会发火的。"

# rich_translation: <b>嗯，佐伊……也许我……偶尔会忽略一些事。只要你……好好求我的话。</b>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Well, Zoey... Maybe I... overlook a few things here or there. If you ask... <b>nicely</b>.
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, Zoey... Maybe I... overlook a few things here or there. If you ask... nicely."
msgstr "嗯，佐伊……也许我……偶尔会忽略一些事。只要你……好好求我的话。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, apparently it"
msgstr "嗯，看来这玩意儿"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Well, dear... Just at least let us take a look around. Maybe your little security systems aren't as secure as you think."
msgstr "嗯，亲爱的……至少让我们四处看看嘛。也许你那套小小的安保系统，并没有你想象的那么牢靠。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, don't tell anyone I said this, but you may have a secret admirer. They've sent me up to look for ya."
msgstr "嗯，别跟别人说我说过这话，不过你可能是有个秘密仰慕者。他们派我来找你。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, it was mainly Zoey here. I just rode along."
msgstr "嗯，主要是佐伊在操作，我只是搭个顺风车而已。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Well, let's be real.. You didn't do this purely out of kind-heartedness, now did you, hmm?~"
msgstr "好吧，说真的……你这么做可纯粹不是因为心地善良吧，嗯？~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, of course I know her. She's me."
msgstr "那当然知道啦。她就是我啊。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, the dust seems to be somewhat settling now."
msgstr "嗯，现在尘埃似乎总算开始落定了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, the scenery's enjoying you too, sexy~"
msgstr "嗯，这风景也在欣赏你呢，小可爱~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Well, uh... there's this andro woman that I found without power-"
msgstr "嗯……我找到了一个没电的安卓女——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "Well, well, well. That's what she said too."
msgstr "哦，哦，哦。她也是这么说的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Well, well. Full of surprises, aren't ya? I was expecting ya to flash me. Didn't think you'd actually show me her tits instead."
msgstr "哦，哦。真是让人意外啊，对吧？我本来以为你会直接给我看。没想到你居然真的把她的奶子给我看了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, yeah. You gotta wear that suit if you wanna work there."
msgstr "嗯，也对。想在那儿工作，就得穿上那套制服。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well, you have fun with that. I need to take a shower too. Scoot over."
msgstr "嗯，你玩得开心就好。我也得去洗个澡了。挪开点。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Well, you help nice old ladies like me find their cats. That's quite the service you provide, darling. Something to be celebrated."
msgstr "嗯，你帮像我这样的慈祥老太太找猫，这可真是项了不起的服务呢，亲爱的。值得好好庆祝一下。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- I guess I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "嗯……好吧，我试试看能怎么做。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- I won't keep ya any longer. Gotta go prepare for some gala thing anyways. You go save the world, okay?"
msgstr "嗯……我也不会留你太久啦。反正得去准备什么晚会活动。你去拯救世界吧，好吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- I... I don't know... That sounds pretty intense."
msgstr "嗯……我……我不知道……这听起来挺刺激的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- If she used to be outdoor... She should be fine. We just gotta go out and look for her."
msgstr "嗯——如果她以前常待在外面的话……那她现在应该还安全。我们只要出去找找她就行了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- If she went out the vent, then... She could be anywhere outside in the district by now."
msgstr "嗯——如果她是通过通风口出去的，那……现在她可能已经到区外的任何地方了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Well- It was broke, but not anymore."
msgstr "嗯——它之前是坏了，但现在不是了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Well- No promises. Love ya, Sarah."
msgstr "嗯……可别指望我。不过，我还是爱你的，莎拉。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- Not exactly? I uh..."
msgstr "嗯……其实也不完全是？我，呃……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- Not me... but yeah, maybe someone smarter would be able to."
msgstr "嗯……不是我啦……不过，或许更聪明的人能行吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Well- Whatever it is. Just take a look for me, would you, dear?"
msgstr "嗯……不管它是什么，就帮我看一眼，好吗，亲爱的？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- Yeaaah, but I mean- I'll figure something out! Now let's get to work before I chicken out!"
msgstr "嗯——，我的意思是——我会想办法的！现在赶紧开工吧，不然我肯定会退缩的！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- Yeah, I am. What sort of job is it?"
msgstr "嗯——是啊，我是。这是什么工作？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well- You'd have to be naked in front of it, of course."
msgstr "嗯——当然啦，你得光着身子站在它面前才行。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well. No, not really. I've got a meeting with my broker in the Redlight District, but-"
msgstr "嗯……其实也不是。我本来在红灯区跟经纪人有个会，但是——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well. You better hurry! It sounds like this thing's gonna go haywire any second now!"
msgstr "好吧。你最好快点！听起来这东西随时都会失控！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Well... Here's your pay... Thanks again, dear."
msgstr "嗯……这是你的报酬……再次感谢，亲爱的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... I could think of a way you can earn a little discount."
msgstr "嗯……我倒是有个办法，能让你稍微便宜点。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... I had a cat get into my place through the vents one time... Maybe she managed to get out that way?"
msgstr "嗯……有一次有只猫从通风口溜进我家……也许她是那样逃出去的？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... I mean... hypothetically if you wanted to like... do something like that again... I mean- If you want! We could... again maybe?"
msgstr "嗯……我的意思是……假设如果你想要……再那样来一次的话……我是说——如果你想的话！我们或许可以……再试一次？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Well... I sorta kinda stole it?"
msgstr "嗯……我算是偷来的吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Well... It's called a uh... Crush Blocker."
msgstr "嗯……它叫……“心动阻断器”。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... Let's find out, right?"
msgstr "嗯……那就试试看吧，对吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Well... Needless to say I didn't take her to the pound. Guess I have a soft spot for helpless things. Like Lio... and you."
msgstr "嗯……不用说，我当然没把她送到收容所。大概我对无助的小东西总是心软吧。就像Lio……还有你。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... No, but like... I don't know... I just wish I could say that my dad stood for something, ya know, Z?"
msgstr "嗯……不，但就是……我不知道……我只是希望，我老爸至少能代表点什么东西，懂吗，佐伊？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... No. If my systems didn't trip, then there's no way she left."
msgstr "嗯……不。如果我的系统没有出故障，那她就不可能离开。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Well... Not exactly. But it's helped."
msgstr "嗯……也不能这么说。不过确实有帮助。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... Right back at you, hon. Thanks, Zoey. Now go get paid, girl!"
msgstr "嗯……彼此彼此，亲爱的。谢谢，佐伊。现在去拿你的钱吧，姑娘！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Well... Thank you for checking at least, dear."
msgstr "嗯……至少你肯来查看，谢天谢地，亲爱的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Well... The way here for starters. Buncha pipes burst, so the tunnels were filled with haze."
msgstr "嗯……首先，是来这儿的路。一堆管道爆了，所以隧道里全是烟雾。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... Whatever works for you, I guess."
msgstr "嗯……随你高兴吧，我猜。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... Whatever! So what? What are they gonna do?"
msgstr "嗯……随你便！那又怎样？他们能把我怎么样？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Well... Yeah, actually. Lemme see..."
msgstr "嗯……其实，是的。让我看看……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... Yeah, but that doesn't justify secretly recording your customers, right?"
msgstr "嗯……也对，但这并不能成为你偷偷录制顾客理由吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... it looks kinda like..."
msgstr "嗯……它看起来有点像……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... not really..."
msgstr "嗯……其实也不是……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Well... uh... I need to get a fake made of this little device I found."
msgstr "嗯……那个……我需要根据这个我找到的玩意儿做个假零件。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... yeah, at the Glowing Hole, but none of them looked that... lifelike."
msgstr "嗯……倒是在“发光之穴”见过，但那些可没看起来这么……栩栩如生。"

# rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF><b>嗯……你们俩看起来确实有点像……</b></color>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Well... you two <b>do</b> look similar...</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Well... you two do look similar..."
msgstr "嗯……你们俩看起来确实有点像……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wellll, there's a first time for everything, right?"
msgstr "嗯……凡事总有第一次，对吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Welllll... I wouldn't be too sure about that, hun."
msgstr "嗯……这个嘛，我可不敢打包票哦，亲爱的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wellll~ I've been wanting to get my nails done at that fancy salon near here. You ever been there before?"
msgstr "嗯嗯~我一直想去附近那家高级美甲店做做指甲。你以前去过吗？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Werde ich die richtige Entscheidung treffen?"
msgstr "我会做出正确的决定吗？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Were done"
msgstr "完成了"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Were you expecting someone else?~"
msgstr "你是在等别人吗？~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Were you listening?"
msgstr "你在听吗？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "West"
msgstr "西"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wet"
msgstr "湿润"

