msgstr "可不想让顾客踩到玻璃碎片，对吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wouldn't you like to know, hmm~?"
msgstr "你难道不想知道吗，嗯～？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow you"
msgstr "哇，你……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Wow! Cleaning goes so much quicker when I'm not alone!"
msgstr "哇！有个人帮忙，打扫起来快多了！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow! Is this for your erm... 'massages'? What kinda scents?"
msgstr "哇！这是给你那个……“按摩”用的吗？什么香味儿的？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow! Sounds like you two had a good time! So what'd ya do?"
msgstr "哇！听起来你们俩玩得挺开心的！那后来你们干嘛了？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow! That run was amazing! Gah, I wish I could pull off the things you can, Zoey. You're so awesome. I'll publish this right now!"
msgstr "哇！那轮表现太棒了！啊，真希望我也能做到你那些事，佐伊。你真是太厉害了。我这就发布！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow! That's impressive! I can't imagine what that must feel like... I've never really- Ya know. Done anything."
msgstr "哇！太令人印象深刻了！我简直无法想象那是什么感觉……我从来都没有真正——你知道的——做过任何事。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow, look at you, Zoey. Got a job at the Glowing Hole, huh?"
msgstr "哇，看看你，佐伊。在“发光之洞”找到工作啦，是吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Wow, really? The heart rate?"
msgstr "哇，真的假的？连心率都能测出来？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow, that is one hell of a meltdown~ You thinking about what you'd prefer to be under there?"
msgstr "哇，这可真是一场猛烈的崩溃呢~ 你在想自己下面到底更想要什么吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Wow, that's quite the computer."
msgstr "哇，这电脑可真够劲的。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow, that's scary! Did you open?"
msgstr "哇，真吓人！你打开了吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow, your nails look amazing!"
msgstr "哇，你的指甲看起来太棒了！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow- U-Uh... Yeah- I mean! I guess we could try it... heh..."
msgstr "哇——呃……嗯……我意思是！我想我们可以试试……嘿嘿……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow. Look at her skin! What is the collagen count in that copolymer?"
msgstr "哇。看看她的皮肤！那种共聚物里的胶原蛋白含量是多少？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "Wow. Lookin' good, ladies."
msgstr "哇哦。各位女士，看起来不错嘛。"

# rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>哇……好光滑，好温暖~</color>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Wow... So smo<color=#EB83FF>oth and warm~</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow... So smooth and warm~"
msgstr "哇……好光滑，好温暖~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow... This is quite the room."
msgstr "哇……这房间可真够特别的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Woww... Lookin' great, waitress..."
msgstr "哇……真漂亮啊，服务员……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Femboy"
msgid "Wow~ Are you new? Haven't seen you around."
msgstr "哇～你是新来的吗？以前没见过你呢。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow~ Listen to you~ So far gone~ and still remembering your manners~ Good girl~"
msgstr "哇~听听你这话~都糊涂成这样了~还知道讲礼貌~好孩子~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Max"
msgid "Wow~ Look at you! I love those! How about you, Zoey?"
msgstr "哇~ 看看你！我超喜欢这些美甲！你呢，佐伊？"

