msgid "Y'er even hotter than the las' waitress that worked here... *hic*"
msgstr "你比上次在这儿上班的女服务员还火辣……*hic*"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Y'er personalities couldn'a been more diffrnt', ehehe..."
msgstr "你们的个性简直天差地别，嘿嘿……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Y'er tit flaps are blocking ya tip, waitresh *hic*."
msgstr "小丫头，你的胸肉把小弟弟挡住了，等等……*打嗝*。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Y- Yes, sir...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y- Yes, sir..."
msgstr "是，先生……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Mira"
msgid "Y- um... I-..."
msgstr "呃……我……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y- you pressed it?"
msgstr "你——你按了它？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-Yeah!"
msgstr "是！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-Yeah! Yeah, tomorrow night. No problem! I'll keep laying low."
msgstr "是！是，明天晚上。没问题！我会继续藏起来的。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Y-Yes ma'am... Like a good pet...</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-Yes ma'am... Like a good pet..."
msgstr "是……夫人……就像一只乖宠物……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Y-Yes, ma'am... Pleasee... Hhh...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y-Yes, ma'am... Pleasee... Hhh..."
msgstr "是，夫人……求您了……嗯……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-You sure?"
msgstr "你……你确定吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-yah..! Right!"
msgstr "是——！对！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-yeah.. Got it!"
msgstr "嗯……知道了！"

# rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>是……是啊！我很乐意……跟你一起上楼，嘿嘿！</color>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Y-yeahh..! I'd <color=#EB83FF>love</color> to.. come upstairs with you, heh!
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-yeahh..! I'd love to.. come upstairs with you, heh!"
msgstr "是……是啊！我很乐意……跟你一起上楼，嘿嘿！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y-yes, I am. I just recently... joined."
msgstr "是，我是。我只是最近……加入的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y-yes, sir..."
msgstr "是……是，先生……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Y-yes. Okay...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y-yes. Okay..."
msgstr "是……好的……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Y-yes... You two look amazing...</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-yes... You two look amazing..."
msgstr "是……你们两个看起来太棒了……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Y-you're... welcome... Hhh...</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Y-you're... welcome... Hhh..."
msgstr "你……不用谢……嗯……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Y-you've seen enough!</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y-you've seen enough!"
msgstr "你——你已经看够了！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "YAH"
msgstr "YAH"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "YALREADY KNOW"
msgstr "我早就知道了"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "YES"
msgstr "YES"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "YOU KNOW WHAT YOU DESERVE!"
msgstr "你知道你该得到什么吗！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "YOU made this choice, skank! You kneeled in the flesh! You knew exactly what it meant! You. Want. This."
msgstr "是你自己选的，贱人！你亲眼看着自己跪下的！你很清楚这意味着什么！你……想要这个。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ya hear this gutter trash?"
msgstr "你听见这些下水道里的垃圾在说什么吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ya'd make a killing if ye wanted, hah!"
msgstr "你要是想，能赚得盆满钵满呢，哈！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yahaha! I found you."
msgstr "哈哈哈！找到你了。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yay!"
msgstr "太棒了！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yay!! I'll walk you through every step, honey!"
msgstr "耶！！我会一步步教你，亲爱的！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeaaah, true."
msgstr "嗯，确实。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeaah, I chipped one of them when I went dumpster diving. I figured I'd stay with the tried and true. If it ain't broke, ya know?"
msgstr "嗯，我翻垃圾桶的时候把其中一颗指甲弄裂了。所以我就决定还是用原来的颜色吧。毕竟，如果没坏的话，就没必要换，对吧？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeaah~ That's it, cutie~ Mmm~ Your hands are so soft too~"
msgstr "嗯~就是这样，小可爱~嗯~你的双手也这么柔软呢~"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah"
msgstr "是啊"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah of course! You pay more rent than me anyways. But since when have you cared about your hair that much?"
msgstr "是啊，当然可以！反正你交的房租比我多。不过，你什么时候开始那么在意自己的头发了？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah that's a good idea... Would you please help this old bird, Zoey? I... I don't know what I'd do without her. I'll make it worth your while!"
msgstr "是啊，这主意不错……你能帮帮这个老家伙吗，佐伊？我……我不知道没有她我会怎么样。我会让你觉得这值得的！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Yeah that's right, eheheh. Get me a drink. I want to stare at your ass carrying my tips around."
msgstr "是啊，没错，嘿嘿嘿。给我来一杯饮料。我想看着你端着我的小费到处跑时那副屁股的样子。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah we did do dat"
msgstr "是啊，我们确实那么干了"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr "是啊！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! And now the damn thing won't open. Can you help me?"
msgstr "是啊！可现在这破玩意儿打不开了。你能帮帮我吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! I'm a huge believer in crafting my own look. It lets me have my own personal aesthetic, you know?"
msgstr "是啊！我特别相信打造自己的风格。这样我就能拥有属于自己独特的美学，你懂吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Is that a push-up bra? Do you even need that?"
msgstr "是啊！那是聚拢内衣吗？你真的需要那玩意儿吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! It's right there in the name, right? Everyone loves a gal who's not afraid to bare it all. Plus the pay's good."
msgstr "是啊！名字里不就写着呢？谁都喜欢那种不介意全裸示众的女孩。而且报酬也不低。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Jaime, Sarah. Sarah, Jaime."
msgstr "是啊！贾米，莎拉。莎拉，贾米。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Talk-"
msgstr "是啊！说——"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Thanks for the help, officers! Heh..."
msgstr "是啊！谢谢你们的帮助，警官们！嘿嘿……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! That woman strikes me as the type to keep the best for herself."
msgstr "是啊！那女人看起来就是那种会把最好的东西留给自己的人。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "Yeah! What's your name?"
msgstr "是啊！你叫什么名字？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! You'd love him, he's a treat. You got a hubby too?"
msgstr "是啊！你会超爱他的，他简直太棒了。你也有老公吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I don't know about this. You can deal with it yourself."
msgstr "是啊，这事儿我也不清楚。你自己看着办吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I figured. Didn't think a group calling themselves \"The Cartel\" would be good news."
msgstr "是啊，我也这么想的。没想到一个自称“卡特尔”的组织会是什么好消息。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I got a transfer, but... The value is smaller than last time."
msgstr "是啊，我确实收到了转账，但是……金额比上次要少。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Yeah, I got it!</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I got it!"
msgstr "嗯，我懂啦！"

# rich_translation: <i>是啊，我拿到那些东西了。谢了。真庆幸自己不用出门。</i>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Yeah, I got them. Thanks. Am I ever glad to <i>not</i> go outside.
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I got them. Thanks. Am I ever glad to not go outside."
msgstr "是啊，我拿到那些东西了。谢了。真庆幸自己不用出门。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I guess that's me."
msgstr "嗯，算是吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I know."
msgstr "是啊，我知道。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Max"
msgid "Yeah, I mean- it was just a little black thing. Barely covered the knockers, you know how it is. He wanted the big tiddies too."
msgstr "是啊，我的意思是——那不过就是一条小黑裙。几乎遮不住我的胸，你懂的。他还想要大胸呢。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I see! Wow, you really saved my synthetic bacon. Hey, whatever you girls want, you can have it. On the house."
msgstr "是啊，我懂啦！哇，你真的救了我的合成培根。嘿，你们这些女孩想要什么，尽管拿去吧。我请客。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I sorta figured."
msgstr "嗯，我大概也猜到了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I'll go give it to her. Just gimme a minute, I'll be back."
msgstr "行，我去给她。就给我一分钟，马上回来。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I'm a stunner."
msgstr "是啊，我确实是个大美人。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I- I did get them in the end."
msgstr "嗯……我最后确实拿到它们了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I- uh... I'm almost there..."
msgstr "是啊，我——呃……我快到了……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, Klaudia, um... she had one for me."
msgstr "是啊，克劳迪娅，嗯……她给我准备了一个。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, Zoey. Our business is with her, not you. So YOU back off, bitch."
msgstr "是啊，佐伊。我们的事是她，不是你。所以，你给我退后，婊子。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, because he bent the knee immediately. He didn't even put up a shred of fight."
msgstr "是啊，因为他立刻就跪了。连一点反抗都没有。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, but it's kinda funny in retrospect."
msgstr "是啊，不过事后想想还挺好笑的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, but not like this. Those guys are bad news."
msgstr "是啊，但不是这样。那帮人可不是什么好鸟。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah, but that's not something you can explain to a cat. She was antsy at first, but... I thought it was enough. That I was enough..."
msgstr "是啊，但那种事你没法跟猫解释。她一开始很不安，不过……我觉得这样就够了。我……已经足够好了……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, don't feel like walkin' all the way outside today. Feeling kinda shitty lately. Must be under the weather."
msgstr "是啊，今天可不想大老远地走到外面去。最近感觉有点糟，大概是感冒了吧。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, guess not. No big score for me. I'll be lucky if I even survive."
msgstr "是啊，看来不是了。我什么也捞不着。能活下来就算走运了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, he uh... wrote a letter for you."
msgstr "是啊，他呃……给你写了封信。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah, here... she used to like going to this... sketchy place."
msgstr "是啊，这里……她以前喜欢去一个……有点可疑的地方。"

# rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>是啊，看起来真的不错……我的意思是——细节处理得非常到位！</color>
#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Yeah, <color=#EB83FF>it looks really good</color>... I mean- good attention to detail!
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, it looks really good... I mean- good attention to detail!"
msgstr "是啊，看起来真的不错……我的意思是——细节处理得非常到位！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, it's just a Rogue relay node. Made my first one when I was 12."
msgstr "是啊，这不过是个“叛逆者”中继节点而已。我12岁的时候就造出第一个了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, just getting it fixed up right now. This is gonna take a while."
msgstr "是啊，正在修呢。这得花点时间。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, me too, bestie."
msgstr "是啊，我也是，闺蜜。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, me too... Do you think painkillers would work on it?"
msgstr "是啊，我也是……你觉得止痛药会对它有用吗？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, no worries."
msgstr "嗯，没事的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, not looking forward to that either."
msgstr "是啊，我也挺不乐意的。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, see ya."
msgstr "嗯，回头见。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, she has a gig pulling security there."
msgstr "是啊，她在那儿干安保的活儿呢。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, sure. I'll help you out."
msgstr "行啊，没问题。我帮你就是了。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, thanks! Easy fix."
msgstr "是啊，谢了！简单修好了。"

